{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e0ec72c4c0b832855d66a1ccb755924e513baf50dbb48f9a5d4fb5c410dfc322","ja":"とっておきの暑さ対策","zh":"珍藏的防暑妙招","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a218c0dd80cd62f26644c5f01a507b8befa0226320d3aecf6c3969d222e4e563","ja":"今日のお仕事は、ロケ。\n強い日差しが照り付ける中、撮影は進んで……","zh":"今天的工作是外景拍摄。\n在烈日的暴晒下，拍摄继续进行着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ac70c0fa316ea6eb002f89ae211764f876d7b57f5ab087c5b003eb10f69ce668","ja":"「休憩入りまーす！\n涼しいところで、休んでいてください！」","zh":"“现在开始休息——！\n请大家到凉爽的地方休息吧！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"27e6bb70499223d0ef31aa959040f30284f618e107b84e1983d1fa6f850fd15d","ja":"はい～。日陰に行ってますね～。\n今日は特に、かんかん照りですな～。","zh":"好的～。我去阴凉处待着了～。\n今天这太阳真是格外晒人啊～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4fcbeb7b4613c8a6357307059bba690132668b09fd274296290150268800c2ee","ja":"暑すぎて溶けちゃいそうなの～。\n衣装も汗でベタベタになっちゃいそうって思うな。","zh":"太热了，感觉整个人都要融化了～。\n总觉得演出服也会被汗水弄得黏糊糊的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c47b67827f575ed717f9ac5529ae0666246e5b2c03c2ab9a179a534eaefb045c","ja":"だな……ふぅ。\nなんか飲み物でも買ってくるか……。","zh":"是啊……呼。\n去买点喝的什么的吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e1f9f24fa183f3f3767b4629f2e39d6ac89671a015d16d5c9644ce6f3b5a974a","ja":"ふっふっふ、こんなこともあろうかと思って……\nじゃじゃーん♪　莉緒お姉さん特製のレモン水よ♪","zh":"哼哼哼，我就料到会有这种情况……\n噔噔——♪　这可是莉绪大姐姐特制的柠檬水哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"76e588b5a916d960bc619ed44e3d557a09efc2558ad2e538f1c0fa85c2739e84","ja":"はい、どうぞ♪　疲れが吹き飛んじゃうわよ！\nたくさん作ってきたから、遠慮しないで飲んでね。","zh":"来，请用♪　能帮你把疲劳全都吹走哦！\n我做了很多，别客气，尽管喝吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c504aa75eb075da34ddadd1c9d744741395d41df578dbcfab71774cfafcb30b7","ja":"紙コップまで用意してくれたのか！\nサンキュー、莉緒姉！","zh":"连纸杯都准备好了吗！\n谢啦，莉绪姐！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"91fed6fd0e38561e2c85c8925137388aaffbf581efc173614c44dffdd695f9ef","ja":"……うん、うまいよ！　よく冷えてるし！","zh":"……嗯，很好喝哦！而且冰得正合适！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"cf1308f65225e559d22c39d62ee9231dd69d05a7d8f6a9aec8d7856260f84f8c","ja":"すっごくおいしいの～☆　この後の撮影、\nもうちょっと頑張ってもいいかも、って思うな。","zh":"超级好吃呢～☆ 感觉接下来的拍摄，\n我再多加一把劲也可以哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"4830be6847623ab2e5d9cba3162cb36ee6e60301866d276bad4dd123af603350","ja":"本当に、生き返りますな～。\n莉緒さん、ありがとうございます～。","zh":"真是让人活过来了呢～\n莉绪姐，太感谢你了～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"b6b5c78b0ea454f4a7658dc5d4fad2881ad2590cd1f3e15603e2b75d55763602","ja":"どういたしまして♪\nでもね、まだこれで終わりじゃないのよ～。","zh":"不客气♪\n不过呢，这可还没结束哦～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1615.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"7a116f6ece38f640682b38cd97b74fc6dee701d69e3bf8760a51e3e337fad7bd","ja":"……ん、なにがあるんだ？","zh":"……嗯？有什么事吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
